BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flavour Harvest Pull Up A Chair Harvest Lunch at the Market
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260629T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260629T190000
UID:blogto-237088@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/26/original_imaged64a406e-bb22-4829-b9f8-ef673ef815
 28.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Pull Up A Chair Harvest Lunch\n​Farm-to-table dining usually
  involves a trip from the farm to the restaurant. This meal skips a few st
 eps.\n​Join us at Sorauren Farmers' Market for a special Pull Up A Chair
  Harvest Lunch with FulCircle Collective and Chef Funmilade Taiwo of Lamur
 en Supperclub.\n​Set right in the heart of the market\, this communal me
 al celebrates seasonal ingredients\, contemporary Nigerian cuisine\, and t
 he simple magic of gathering around a table just steps from where your foo
 d begins.\nFT is the creative force behind Lámurén\, a beloved supper cl
 ub inspired by his paternal hometown of Okelamuren in Ijebu Ode\, Nigeria.
  🇳🇬 Through his cooking\, he pays heartfelt homage to heritage\, com
 munity\, and the stories that live within food.\nFor our June 29 Pull Up A
  Chair Harvest Lunch at Sorauren Farmers’ Market\, FT will be bringing h
 is signature approach to seasonal ingredients with a menu featuring:\n🥬
  Obe Ata Braised Hakurei Turnips\n🌱 Stewed Turnip Greens\n🥗 Fresh Mi
 xed Green Salad\nRooted in a deep respect for Nigerian culinary traditions
  and guided by an adventurous spirit in the kitchen\, FT transforms local\
 , peak-season produce into dishes that are both comforting and surprising.
 \nJoin us around the table for an afternoon of great food\, connection\, a
 nd a fresh take on what local ingredients can become.\n🎟️ $25!\nLocat
 ion\nSorauren Farmers’ Market\nTickets here: https://luma.com/fk6yzvam
LOCATION:Sorauren Farmers' Market
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/flavour-harvest-pull-up-a-chair-harvest-
 lunch-at-the-market-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
