 gto.com/events/2026/06/16/original_image8687e05c-8052-48e2-913d-770d0d5708
 c6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:"Pay What You Can" to watch this comedy show at Toronto Fringe
 .\nFrom the makers of award-winning comedies like "Colonial Circus" and "O
 nce Upon a Time in Bollywood" comes another banger. Get everything from 'M
 aa' to 'Mafia' in this riotous fringe comedy that stylizes Diversity\, Equ
 ity\, and Inclusion with Bollywood colours. Follow ambitious coworkers in 
 a comedy of “dead” lines\, “bullet” points\, and a Chief “Execut
 ing” Officer\, while sparks fly in Bollywood-style romance. Family melod
 rama collides with office politics and unapologetic nepotism\, erupting in
 to dance numbers and action—yes\, even gunshots. Beneath the spectacle l
 ies sharp satire and surprising heart\, as characters fight for belonging 
 and something better. Irreverent\, vibrant\, and unapologetically over-the
 -top.\nDirector: Seann Murray | Writers and Performers: Hinprov Emsemble (
 Jeff\, Gunjan\, Sachin\, Shreya and Vinay) | Light design and Stage Manage
 ment: Tushar Dalvi See less
LOCATION:SOULPEPPER THEATRE'S WEYNI MENGESHA THEATRE
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/dei-another-day-at-toronto-fringe-toront
