 42.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Manifestation expert Kathleen Cameron is launching her transfo
 rmative new book\, My Manifested Life\, and guests are invited to celebrat
 e with women from all walks of life who've stepped into their power.\nMy M
 anifested Life tells the stories of women who stopped living as who they'd
  been and took that leap of faith into who they're becoming. These are rea
 l transformations. New jobs. New relationships. New identities. Not becaus
 e it was easy\, but because they were willing to grow and commit to their 
 dreams.\nJoin Kathleen Cameron for an inspiring evening filled with meanin
 gful conversations\, networking\, and photo opportunities. Guests will rec
 eive their own copy of the book\, enjoy light snacks and drinks\, and conn
 ect with an amazing community of women redefining success.
