 i a hundred times and tonight you're finally going in.\nQE Trivia at the R
 ivoli is for the culture crowd — music lovers\, film heads\, pop culture
  obsessives\, and anyone who just wants a Tuesday that actually means some
 thing.\n🏆 PRIZES\nGRETA 1 Hour Unlimited Play Cards\n1 Hour Free Billia
 rds @ The Rivoli\nSecond City vouchers\nWeekly rotating sponsor prizes\n
