 64.jpg
DESCRIPTION:🎉 Celebrate Canada Day at Yonge North York! 🍁\nGet ready
  for an unforgettable Canada Day celebration! Join us at Mel Lastman Squar
 e for a full day of entertainment\, live music\, and activities that are s
 ure to make the day last forever! No admission is required\, just walk rig
 ht in and join the fun!\n🎤 Main Stage Entertainment: From DJs to Dances
 \, we are bringing an incredible lineup of live music and dynamic performa
 nces to the Main Stage to keep the energy high all day long.\n🛍️ Bust
 ling Vendor Market: Take a stroll through our vendor area to discover amaz
 ing local businesses\, shop for unique artisan finds\, and grab a bite to 
 eat from our diverse food vendors.\n🎈 Free Kids' Activity Zone: Bring y
 our kids to our completely free\, action-packed activity zone designed jus
 t for them. Also with free facepaint!\n🔥 Fireshow & Fireworks: Stick ar
 ound after sunset for a circus and fire show\, wrapping up the night with 
 a fireworks display!\nFind more details on our website: https://yongenorth
 york.com/canadaday/\nEvent co-hosted with the City of Toronto. This projec
 t is funded in part by the Government of Canada and the Province of Ontari
 o.\nMark your calendars\, gather your friends and family\, and come make s
 ome amazing memories with us!
