BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Artificially Intelligent 2.0
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260702T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260702T223000
UID:blogto-235982@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/03/original_image276f7bb5-2398-488d-aec2-00c240a23b
 e8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Award-winning Greek/Canadian comedian and viral sensation Anes
 ti Danelis returns to the Toronto Fringe from July 2-12 with Artificially 
 Intelligent 2.0\, an update of his hit musical comedy special\, following 
 sold-out runs at the Edinburgh\, Melbourne\, and Sydney comedy festivals. 
 With over one million followers and more than 500 million online views\, a
 nd live appearances across North America and the UK\, Anesti is one of com
 edy’s fastest-rising stars.\nAnesti has to write a comedy special\, but 
 he doesn’t know what to write about\, and he doesn’t really want to do
  the work. So he does what everybody does and outsources creativity to Cha
 tGPT. The problem? ChatGPT doesn’t really know who Anesti is and keeps a
 sking him for more data.
LOCATION:The Alumnae Theatre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/artificially-intelligent-20-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
