 ion of sport\, culture\, music\, and style to Toronto with Beyond The Pitc
 h—an exclusive one-night experience during the world's biggest football 
 tournament.\nSet against the energy of the city\, Beyond The Pitch brings 
 together athletes\, creators\, tastemakers\, and fans for an unforgettable
