DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Candle Making Experience at Artbox\, a hands-on\
 , aromatic workshop where creativity meets cozy vibes.\nLearn step by step
  how to create up to two cocktail-inspired soy candles. You’ll mix and m
 atch scents\, colours\, and décor\, starting with a poured base\, piping 
 whipped wax\, and finishing with decorative wax melts and embellishments. 
 Candles will be ready to take home by the end of the workshop.\nWhat’s I
