 er vessels (approx. 30+ hours burn time per candle)\n• All soy wax\, cot
 ton wicks\, vessels\, and supplies provided\n• Complimentary coffee\, te
 a\, refreshments\, and snacks\nWho Can Attend:\nPerfect for beginners and 
 candle lovers alike. Come solo or with friends—no experience needed.\nGu
 ests must be aged 12+ to participate.\nWorkshops are intimate and spots ar
