SUMMARY:Flavour Harvest Pull Up A Chair Harvest Lunch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260704T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260704T130000
UID:blogto-237091@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/26/original_image4ae2d4a7-4b10-431a-91dc-94f58eb6e6
 f7.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Farm-to-table dining usually involves a trip from the farm to 
 the restaurant. This meal skips a few steps.\nJoin us at Junction Farmers'
  Market for a special Pull Up A Chair Harvest Lunch\, featuring Chef Ben H
 ayward\, founder of Hayward Food Co.\nKnown for unforgettable meals and wa
 rm\, welcoming hospitality\, Ben brings a fresh\, contemporary Canadian ap
 proach to cooking that is rooted in seasonality\, sustainability\, and a g
 enuine love of gathering people around the table. Classically trained in F
 rench cuisine\, his culinary journey has taken him from a neighbourhood bi
 stro in Mississauga to leading the kitchens at some of Toronto's favourite
  restaurants\, including Bar Prima and La Palma.\nFor this one-day market 
 experience\, Ben has created a produce-led brunch inspired by what's at it
 s peak this season. Built around fresh asparagus and strawberries sourced 
 from the market\, the menu celebrates the simple pleasure of exceptional l
 ocal ingredients prepared with care and enjoyed just steps from where they
  were grown.\nMenu\n🍳 Asparagus Benedict\nSoft-poached egg\, sourdough\
 , herby hollandaise\, and market salad\n🍓 Strawberry Rhubarb Smash\nMin
 t\, fresh strawberries\, and soda\nSet right in the heart of Junction Farm
 ers' Market\, this communal meal offers a chance to experience the market 
 in a whole new way\, not just as a place to shop\, but as a place to gathe
 r\, connect\, and share a seasonal meal with fellow food lovers.\nWhether 
 you've experienced Ben's hospitality before or are meeting him for the fir
 st time\, pull up a chair and join us.\nSaturday\, July 4\n📍 Junction F
 armers' Market\n🕘 Seatings\n9:45-10:30 am\n11:00-11:45 am\n12:15-1:00 p
 m\n🎟️ $25 per person\nSeats are limited. Advance tickets are recommen
 ded.\nhttps://luma.com/calendar/cal-CrBxhgYigJSeggk
LOCATION:The Junction Farmers' Market
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/flavour-harvest-pull-up-a-chair-harvest-
 lunch-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
