 lent. With competitors from near and far\, the event is expanding as a pla
 tform for high-caliber competition and community connection.\nThe event at
 tracted over 100 contestants this year\, setting the stage for a full slat
 e of battles and live performances\, with dancers competing for a $3\,400 
