 brings together a hand-picked lineup: jjared\, Kieren\, and Kelson Frederi
 cks. Independent artists\, live instrumentation\, an intimate crowd\, and 
 a space that allows for full immersion.\njjared’s music is aimed at anyo
 ne who's gone numb to the magic of everyday life. Expect tracks off his de
 but EP\, God Dreams\, alongside new material he’ll be sharing for the fi
 rst time.\nKieren brings his own full band to blend alt-R&B\, drum and bas
 s\, and rock into a sound that's entirely his own\, a direct line into his
  perspective. Unreleased tracks are part of the set.\nKelson Fredericks mo
 ves through R&B\, jazz\, neo soul\, and hip hop\, music made to be felt an
 d danced to. He’s bringing his newest single "FIGHT!" to the stage live 
 for the first time\nExpect a night built on music\, community\, and connec
 tion.
