 62.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Do you want more clients? Join us for GTApreneurs July 8-2026 
 Afternoon Virtual Business Networking Event to connect with other amazing 
 entrepreneurs\, learn something new and promote your business!\nREGISTER H
 ERE: https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-toronto\nThis event will fe
 ature Guest Speaker Allan Pollett\, SEO Guru & CEO\, Global Net Trade. Sin
 ce 1998\, Allan has been working as a SEO and web marketing specialist. He
  is known as the "SEO Guru" having written several books on reputation man
 agement\, social media and SEO related topics. Over the years\, he has hel
 ped over a 1000 businesses get to the top of the organic search results. O
 ne of his most recent achievements is helping one of his clients generate 
