BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Join Our Community Consultation: Know Your Rights. Name the Harm. 
 Take Action: July 9
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260709T173000
UID:blogto-236950@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/24/original_image5b6df10b-557e-42df-978a-11e044742f
 4e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Heritage Skills Development Centre (HSDC) warmly invites you t
 o join our upcoming community dialogue: From Microaggression to Action: Un
 derstanding the Law and Building Safer Workplaces: Know Your Rights. Name 
 the Harm. Take Action. The session will conduct on Thursday\, July 9\, 202
 6\, from 4:00 – 5:30 PM on Zoom.\n\nWorkplace microaggressions and haras
 sment can have lasting impacts on individuals\, teams\, and organizational
  culture. Yet many employees are uncertain about their rights\, reporting 
 options\, and the resources available when concerns arise.\nJoin us for th
 is timely and informative discussion featuring an employment lawyer and DE
 I consultants\, who will share practical knowledge and strategies to help 
 participants:\nUnderstand workplace harassment and discrimination laws in 
 Ontario\nLearn how to document and report incidents effectively\nExplore o
 ptions when internal reporting systems are unavailable or ineffective\nDis
 cover legal and community resources available to support victims\nBuild co
 nfidence to advocate for themselves and others\n\nWhether you are an emplo
 yee\, manager\, community member\, newcomer\, or frontline worker\, this d
 ialogue will provide valuable information to help create safer and more re
 spectful workplaces for all. Please register here: https://forms.gle/iKwEv
 oFn7DmA11x58\nPlease see the attached flyer and feel free to share this in
 vitation with your colleagues\, friends\, and networks. Together\, we can 
 move from awareness to action and build workplaces rooted in dignity\, saf
 ety\, and respect.\nParticipants who attend the session will be entered in
 to a raffle draw for a chance to win an e-gift card! We look forward to ha
 ving you join us for this important conversation.
LOCATION:Virtual Event
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/join-our-community-consultation-know-you
 r-rights-name-the-harm-take-action-july-9-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
