BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:4th Annual Appreciation BBQ
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T180000
UID:blogto-237084@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/26/original_image9d9a8ee1-b938-4ef5-ad4f-00bbd4041d
 0c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 4th Annual Appreciation BBQ\, a free community
  event designed to bring people together through food\, music\, fun\, and 
 meaningful connection.\nHosted by TimeForUS Wellness Hub\, this annual eve
 nt celebrates the importance of community as a vital part of our well-bein
 g. Whether you're coming with family\, friends\, or on your own\, you'll e
 njoy an afternoon filled with activities for all ages in a welcoming and i
 nclusive environment.\nEvent Highlights:\nFree BBQ (while supplies last)\n
 Live DJs throughout the afternoon\nLocal vendor marketplace\nChildren's cr
 eative activity station\nLawn games and entertainment\nLive performances\n
 Raffle prizes and giveaways\nOpportunities to connect with local organizat
 ions and community members\nThis year's event is made even more special th
 rough collaborations with Sundé Social\, Hip Hop Healing\, LivingRoom Com
 munity Art Studio\, and BCurrent Performing Arts\, creating an engaging ex
