 it the recovery station by Mobility House for mini-massages\, etc & more. 
 Get a complimentary drink at the Matcha bar or the hydration station and j
 oin us for a sound bath while the waves lap in the background. Enjoy somet
 hing tasty\, upgrade your selfie game\, meet some new folks or just vibe t
 o the sounds of R&B!\nMat Pilates + Boxing Cardio + Sound Baths\nRecovery 
 Station by Mobility House\nComplimentary Matcha bar + Complimentary hydrat
 ion station + Small bites\nCommunity + Live DJs + Photo Ops + Unmatched ve
 nue\nArrive solo\, with a friend or anyone who's health & wellness you car
 e about! Jump into every class or duck into the Recovery Station for some 
 self-care! It's up to you how you want to pace your day\, it can be as int
 ense or calming as you like. If you've hit your max\, feel free to hit the
  hydration station or sip a complimentary matcha on the beach. Or join the
  sound bath with the waves as a backdrop.\nThe goal is to activate your bo
 dy\, introduce you to a supportive tribe\, have some delicious treats\, en
