 n the first day of a new year\, spotting the elusive white squirrel of Tri
 nity Bellwoods park\, or grabbing a beef patty on your way home from schoo
 l\, this workshop is about commemorating the things that make Toronto a sp
 ecial place to you.\nYou will learn how to create your own image on styrof
 oam blocks and then print a series of 5 “Toronto trading cards”. At th
 e end of the workshop\, you are invited to trade some of your cards with y
