BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Parkside Live Presents: Joaquin Nunez & Habana Safari
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260715T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260715T200000
UID:blogto-236387@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/10/original_image168e2e91-ac64-42b2-9734-420c917b9f
 33.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Joaquin Nuñez & Habana Safari\nContemporary\, fresh\, Afro-Cu
 ban jazz\nWednesday July 15th\, 7:00-8:00PM\nSponsored by: Smiles Dentistr
 y\nBring your blanket and lawnchairs for a magical evening of music in the
  garden of Redeemer Lutheran Church. This FREE/PAY-WHAT-YOU-CAN. show supp
 orts the Bloor by the Park Community Pantry.\nHabana Safari is an authenti
 c Cuban music project. Founded in 2007 by Multi-Juno Award Winner\, Cuban 
 Master percussionist Joaquin Nunez\, and formed by some of the greatest Cu
 ban musicians in the City of Toronto\, the project has earned a reputation
  as one of the most unique Cuban music acts in the Canadian music scene.\n
 The concept and repertoire of the band encompass a retrospective of Cuban 
 music since its inception in the nineteenth century with the Danza\, Contr
 adanza\, and Danzon\, genres that blend elements of European classical mus
 ic and African rhythms\, paving the way for what the world knows today as 
 Cuban music.\nBuilding on this concept\, Habana Safari has developed a con
 temporary\, fresh\, and unique sound of melodies and songs representative 
 of Afro-Cuban jazz yet rooted in the authenticity and beauty of traditiona
 l Cuban music. The band’s format includes traditional Cuban and Afro-Cub
 an instruments such as bata drums\, as well as characteristic instruments 
 of Latin music: trumpet\, piano\, acoustic bass\, and violin.\nBeyond the 
 instrumentation\, the beautiful voice of the lead singer and the wealth of
  percussion moments throughout the show are the elements that make the sou
 nd of the band genuine. The Habana Safari Show is electrifying\, connectin
 g with all kinds of audiences in any setting\, actively engaging them at v
 arious times of the show\, making the Habana Safari Show an unforgettable 
 experience.
LOCATION:Redeemer Lutheran Church
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/parkside-live-presents-joaquin-nunez-hab
 ana-safari-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
