 gto.com/events/2026/06/12/original_image530d4401-5dae-4ceb-8be5-d6ef8bc3ac
 8e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Excellent! Test your knowledge of Springfield's finest family\
 , unforgettable quotes\, and decades of Simpsons history\nAy caramba!\nWe'
 re heading back to the Golden Age of The Simpsons for a trivia night dedic
 ated exclusively to Seasons 1–7!\nFrom Homer's misadventures and Bart's 
 pranks to Springfield's unforgettable residents\, classic episodes\, runni
 ng gags\, and legendary one-liners\, this game celebrates the era that mad
