 5b.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The AGO's Breakfast Club is a relaxed social art class that bl
 ends creativity with a light morning nosh. The morning begins with coffee 
 or tea and a pastry\, offering time to connect and unwind before our artis
 t-instructor leads participants through engaging and accessible drawing de
 monstrations and creative exercises in the galleries.\nWith an emphasis on
  creativity and community\, this workshop welcomes both beginners and expe
 rienced artists. Each participant leaves with a take-home sketchbook to co
 ntinue exploring and expanding their artistic practice beyond the session.
  Gallery admission\, sketching supplies and coffee or tea and a pastry are
  included in the fee.\nThe registration receipt must be presented at the s
 tart of each class. Please check any oversized bags and outerwear. Partici
 pants must be 18 or older. Suitable for beginners. Learn about more course
 s and workshop opportunities.
