 fd.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Kids’ Fairy Garden Workshop\nIn this hands-on workshop\, kid
 s will explore the magical world of fairies as they create their very own 
 enchanting indoor fairy garden to take home!\nOur friendly instructor will
  guide young creators step-by-step as they paint a whimsical fairy door\, 
 plant greenery in a charming container\, and decorate with colourful sand\
 , fun rocks\, and miniature accents to bring their fairy garden to life. T
 his creative\, nature-inspired activity is designed to spark imagination a
 nd hands-on fun.\nAll materials are included\, including plants\, a pot\, 
 soil\, decorative stones\, colourful sand\, a fairy door to paint\, and a 
 variety of miniature accessories.\nRecommended Age: 6+\nPlease Note: Adult
  supervision is required. Each child must be accompanied by a parent or gu
 ardian for the duration of the workshop.\nLet your child’s creativity ru
 n wild as they build a tiny world full of magic\, colour\, and wonder\, an
  unforgettable experience for young artists and fairy lovers alike!\nPleas
 e Note: Some materials may vary slightly from promotional images\, but all
  substitutions will be of equal or greater quality to enhance your experie
 nce.\nVisit our website for more details & to sign up! www.angasfarm.ca
LOCATION:Anga's Farm & Nursery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/angas-farm-kids-workshop-toronto-3/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
