 y\, set iron-clad spiritual boundaries\, and tap into your innate power to
  manifest a life aligned with your truest desires.\nInvestment: $60 per in
 dividual session\nExperience: Entry to the immersive\, 2-hour in-person wo
 rkshop with personalized guidance from Azaria the Alchemist for the group\
 nLive Energy Healing: Integrated collective energy work and alignment duri
 ng the session to clear blocks and anchor your manifestations.\nBottomless
