 6c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Koffler Arts invites you to the seventh chapter of WORLD PLAY\
 , an ongoing series curated by Alon Nashman\, that celebrates Toronto’s 
 extraordinary linguistic and cultural diversity.\nEach edition brings toge
 ther participants with diverse mother tongues who read excerpts of poetry\
 , theatre\, fiction\, philosophy\, and song lyrics in both their original 
 language and in English translation. This chapter’s theme is “Food”.
 \nJoin us as a reader or listener for an immersive journey into phonaesthe
 tics.\nInterested in reading or have questions? Please reach out: worldpla
 y@kofflerarts.org
LOCATION:Koffler Arts
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/world-play-reading-torontos-many-languag
 es-chapter-7-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
