 03.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Dani Thorne Toronto Boat Rave 2026: The Ultimate Summer Hard T
 echno Party on Lake Ontario\nInternational DJ and producer Dani Thorne (to
 uring under her high-octane moniker COM3T) is headlining an exclusive\, op
 en-air sunset boat cruise aboard the Empress of Canada. The ship sets sail
  from the Toronto docks right at the peak of the summer sunset\, offering 
 panoramic\, Instagram-worthy views of the CN Tower skyline.\n3 Floors\, 3 
 Sound Systems & an afterparty going until 7am!\nDani Thorne anchors the ma
 in stage with a relentless wave of hard techno\, heavy bounce\, and drivin
 g tech house.3.Official Lakeside Afterparty Transition:12:00 AM – 7:00 A
 M.\nEvery boat cruise ticket grants you direct entry to the exclusive lake
 side afterparty\, where underground selectors keep the sub-bass pounding u
 ntil sunrise.\nDani Thorne has spent the last few years dominating massive
  global stages like EDC\, Ultra\, and Lollapalooza\, earning serious respe
 ct from underground purists for her dark\, aggressive rave stabs and rapid
 -fire mixing style. Stepping away from standard commercial club formats\, 
 this 500-person capacity sailing turns a luxury vessel into a moving wareh
 ouse rave.\nWarning: Because this is an exclusive 500-person capacity vess
 el\, demand is vastly outpacing availability.\nAlongside:\nB-Rad\nHollsgho
 ul\nMix Signals\nBlendinsilence\nTokio\nSiv\nMadmon\nJossep\nMane Campos
LOCATION:The Empress of Canada
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-boat-rave-w-dani-thorne-actor-hannah-m
 ontana-toronto/
