 to Diversity Festival showcases the rich tapestry of cultures that make ou
 r city so special. As Canada’s most ethnically diverse city\, Toronto is
  home to a dynamic mosaic of communities\, traditions\, and stories — an
 d this festival brings them all together in one unforgettable experience.\
 n🎉What to Expect\n🎉Live music and cultural dance performances🎉\n
 🌮Delicious food from around the world\n🥁Interactive workshops and ar
 t showcases\n💞Meaningful connections across communities\n⭐A safe\, in
 clusive\, and welcoming space for all\n☮️From arts and heritage to cul
 inary delights and creative expression\, TDF2026 celebrates the beauty of 
 diversity and the power of unity.\nAt Moksha Canada\, we believe in honori
 ng the unique differences that make our region thrive. Regardless of race\
