BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TONY MOORE'S AWAKE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260808T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260808T230000
UID:blogto-236021@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/03/original_image6809ee53-5e2e-421f-9ac2-2fecba7778
 ad.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for TONY MOORE'S AWAKE!\nGet ready to be blown away!!!
 \nTony Moore is taking to the stage with his electrifying one-man show\, "
 AWAKE." Tony's journey in the music industry has been nothing short of leg
 endary\, from being an original member of Iron Maiden\, to playing with Me
 atloaf\, and hitting the charts with his own band in Holland\, to touring 
 the world as a member of the band Cutting Crew (I Just Died In Your Arms T
 onight).\nNow\, Tony's bringing his personal brand of musical magic to the
  world with his stunning and soul-stirring solo to perform the unique live
  concept called “AWAKE”. The show is a journey to discover truth\, mea
 ning\, and love in a world that's gone crazy. Tony has combined cutting-ed
 ge graphics\, immersive video\, and unforgettable songs to create an exper
 ience like no other.\nExpect to be wowed by his imaginative stagecraft\, c
 hannelling the spirit of some of the greatest acts of the last four decade
 s\, but with a fresh\, original and deeply personal twist. Audience member
 s have been raving about the show\, saying things like "one of the greates
 t shows they've ever seen”\, "mind-blowing”\, and “electrifying and 
 emotional in equal measure”.\nAfter playing to full houses across the UK
  and in London for over 2 years\; in 2024\, he opened for Steve Harris (Ir
 on Maiden) and his other band British Lion on their sold-out British and g
 lobal tour\, which took AWAKE to countries including Australia\, New Zeala
 nd\, Japan\, North America\, and South America. Tony continues to tour AWA
 KE throughout Europe and the UK\, both as a headliner and as a special gue
 st supporting British Lion.\nDon't miss your chance to experience "AWAKE."
  Get your tickets now!!!\nWith Special Guest: Janest Isabell\nJanest Isabe
 ll is a Singer-Songwriter who encapsulates her music through the intimate 
 intricacies of the connection between emotion and soul. Janest is consiste
 ntly steeped in an artistic narration of vivid expressions of human experi
 ence and imagination. With a voice that is organic in nature\, freeing the
  truth of who she is\, Janest shares her personal show-and-tell of life th
 rough woven writings focused on love\, growth\, and self-discovery\, told 
 with authenticity and care. Her performances invite listeners into a share
 d emotional space\, where vulnerability becomes strength\, connection\, an
 d art.
LOCATION:Rivoli
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/tony-moores-awake-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
