 s\, soaring horns\, and a stage energy that turns every show into a full-b
 lown party. From Lagos to stages across the globe\, they've built a reputa
 tion as one of the most thrilling live acts to come out of Africa's new mu
 sic wave.\nCatch them live on Saturday\, August 15\, 2026 at the Rebel Ent
 ertainment Complex\, Toronto's massive waterfront nightlife destination. E
 xpect a night of highlife\, Afrobeats\, and non-stop dancing as Afrobass F
 est takes over the space.\nThe event is 19+. Early bird tickets are availa
 ble now and moving fast — grab yours before prices climb at www.Afrobass
