 ark\, Scarborough\n✨ What to Expect:\n🎶 Live Performances – Enjoy e
 lectrifying shows from 120+ local & international artists\n🥘 New Taste 
 of Afro-Carib Fest food competition\n🛍️ Vendor Marketplace – Shop u
 nique cultural treasures\,  gifts\, arts and crafts\, from local businesse
 s\n🍲 Food Zone – Indulge in mouth-watering African & Caribbean delica
 cies\n💃  Dance Competitions – Show off your dance moves & win cash pr
 izes\n🥁  Drum & Dance Workshops – Learn from the best and engage with
  our local artists\n🎧 DJ Sound Clash – Non-stop beats from our top DJ
