BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gaurav Kapoor Live
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260912T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260912T190000
UID:blogto-234385@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/29/original_imagef2252ed3-51e9-4aee-8a2c-b0a06e1360
 0e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Gaurav Kapoor is a Delhi-based comedian who quit his corporate
  job to pursue comedy. His appeal often comes from quick observations and 
 relatable storytelling\, with laughs building through rhythm rather than o
 ne-off punchlines. His dry and hilarious humour has been entertaining audi
 ences across the world from Australia to Turkey\, and we are thrilled to b
 e welcoming him to Toronto’s Elgin Theatre. This event will be presented
