 d ALS returns with a challenge built for teams who thrive on strength\, gr
 it\, and determination.\nOn Saturday\, September 19\, head to York Univers
 ity and take on the ultimate test: assemble a team of up to 14 and race ag
 ainst the clock to pull a 42\,000-lb transport truck for 100 metres.\nSpen
