 gto.com/events/2026/04/20/original_imagefc1f7e25-611b-41de-aed8-2d6c852bd6
 84.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The 5th Annual Etobicoke Ribfest X 2026 is presented by Gelate
 ria Italiana and will take place on Friday\, Sept 25 to Sunday\, Sept 27 2
 026 at Colonel Samuel Smith Park\, Kipling and Lakeshore\; convenient for 
 area residents and visitors from all over. Produced by Ontario Festival Gr
 oup.\nFeaturing North America’s Best Rib Teams ready to serve you\, your
  friends and family Award-Winning Mouth-Watering BBQ Smoked Ribs\, Tender 
 Pulled Pork\, Juicy Smoked Brisket\, BBQ Chicken\, Smoked Sausage and thos
 e huge Beef “Dino” Ribs.\nThere will be a variety of festival foods li
 ke corn dogs\, roasted corn\, poutines\, funnel cakes and of course to was
 h it all down nice cold beer. Plenty of activities including a kids zone\,
  Face painting\, Marketplace\, Artisans and more! Watch Live Music all wee
 kend long featuring Tributes and a variety of local bands. Follow us on In
 stagram\, TikTok\, & Like us on Facebook for daily updates!\nLAST ENTRY 
 – 30 minutes before closing\n📅 DATES & TIMES:\n– FRI SEPT 25\, 2026
  | 12:00PM – 10:00PM\n– SAT SEPT 26\, 2026 | 12:00PM – 10:00PM\n– 
 SUN SEPT 27\, 2026 | 12:00PM – 7:00PM\n🎟️ FREE ADMISSION WITH $5 CH
 ARITABLE DONATION SUGGESTED\n🐕 PET-FRIENDLY | ATM ON SITE\nOntario Fest
 ival Group & Ribfest X are committed to eliminating all single-use plastic
 s at our events\, including water bottles\, cups\, containers\, and utensi
 ls. We encourage guests to bring their own reusable water bottles\, which 
 can be refilled at our onsite water stations for FREE. All reusable water 
 bottles must be emptied before entering event grounds.
LOCATION:Colonel Samuel Smith Park
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/etobicoke-ribfest-2026-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
