DESCRIPTION:Toronto Dog Moms and the Riverside BIA invite you and your dog
  to explore the welcoming streets of Riverside\, a neighbourhood where old
  meets new in all the right ways. Known for its iconic Queen Street East s
 trip\, Riverside blends historic architecture\, community-driven businesse
 s\, and creative flair.\nExpect to discover hidden gems\, meet fellow dog 
 lovers\, and enjoy a relaxed stop at a local patio\, perfect for winding d
 own and soaking up the neighbourhood vibe.\nJoin us for a joyful afternoon
  that celebrates Riverside’s rich history\, strong sense of community\, 
 and pet-friendly atmosphere.
